      "arenaLabPresetId": "f2-big-panda-wei",
      "arenaLabEvidence": "Verified in canonical combat arena preset `f2-big-panda-wei` with deterministic observation: frame 599 (9983.33ms) no cue/banner; frame 600 (10000ms) first themed self-aura telegraph starts with exact `BAMBOO-FED BERSERK \u2014 Big Wei is collecting personally!` announcement. frame 690 (11500ms) first cast resolves and self-buff activates (+40% move, +40% melee, heavy knockback resistance). frame 930 (15500ms) first 4s buff expires and aura cleans up. frame 1290 (21500ms) second telegraph starts; frame 1380 (23000ms) second cast resolves. Cadence and modifier windows are covered by `tests/unit/mob-abilities/bamboo-fed-berserk.test.ts`, runtime script evidence in `scripts/agent/big-panda-wei-arena-evidence.ts`, and browser observation in `tests/e2e/big-panda-wei-arena-observation.test.ts`.",
